    {
      "id": "damping-sim",
      "kind": "content",
      "eyebrow": "交互演示",
      "headline": "转动阻尼旋钮，看三种状态如何演化",
      "lead": "阻尼比 ζ 从零增大到超过 1 时，位移曲线从衰减振荡过渡到单调回归。",
      "notes": "上一页我们推导了三种阻尼状态的数学解，现在请拖动模拟里的阻尼旋钮，重点观察振幅包络线与回到平衡位置的时间。这里要特别纠正一个常见误区：很多同学直觉认为阻尼越大停得越快，但当你把旋钮拧到过阻尼时，会发现系统像在泥沼里一样缓慢爬回原点，反而是临界阻尼能以最快速度稳定且不发生过冲，这正是门吸与减震器的设计原理。需说明的是，模拟中采用的是理想线性粘滞阻尼以严格对应我们的微分方程，真实世界往往还掺杂干摩擦等非线性因素。看完位移随时间的演化，下一页我们将切换视角，进入相空间轨迹，看看系统的能量究竟是如何被耗散掉的。",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "sim",
          "engine": "widget",
          "caption": "拖动滑块调节阻尼比 ζ，观察位移 x(t) 随时间的演化及指数包络线",
          "html": "<style>\n  .shm-wrap { display: flex; flex-direction: column; height: 100%; font-family: inherit; }\n  .shm-controls { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 8px 0; flex-shrink: 0; }\n  .shm-controls label { font-size: 0.9em; white-space: nowrap; }\n  .shm-controls input[type=range] { flex: 1; cursor: pointer; }\n  .shm-state { font-weight: bold; min-width: 80px; text-align: right; }\n  canvas { width: 100%; flex: 1; min-height: 200px; display: block; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"shm-wrap\">\n  <div class=\"shm-controls\">\n    <label>阻尼比 ζ = <span id=\"zeta-val\">0.10</span></label>\n    <input type=\"range\" id=\"zeta-slider\" min=\"0\" max=\"2\" step=\"0.01\" value=\"0.1\">\n    <span class=\"shm-state\" id=\"state-label\">欠阻尼</span>\n  </div>\n  <canvas id=\"cv\"></canvas>\n</div>\n<script>\n  const canvas = document.getElementById('cv');\n  const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n  const slider = document.getElementById('zeta-slider');\n  const zetaVal = document.getElementById('zeta-val');\n  const stateLabel = document.getElementById('state-label');\n\n  let zeta = 0.1;\n  const w0 = 2.0;\n  const dt = 0.02;\n  const maxT = 12;\n  \n  let x = 1.0, v = 0.0, t = 0;\n  let points = [];\n  let animId = null;\n\n  function getThemeColor(varName) {\n    return getComputedStyle(document.documentElement).getPropertyValue(varName).trim();\n  }\n\n  function resizeCanvas() {\n    const rect = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();\n    const dpr = window.devicePixelRatio || 1;\n    canvas.width = rect.width * dpr;\n    canvas.height = rect.height * dpr;\n    ctx.scale(dpr, dpr);\n    drawFrame();\n  }\n\n  function resetSim() {\n    x = 1.0; v = 0.0; t = 0;\n    points = [];\n    if (animId) cancelAnimationFrame(animId);\n    animate();\n  }\n\n  slider.addEventListener('input', (e) => {\n    zeta = parseFloat(e.target.value);\n    zetaVal.textContent = zeta.toFixed(2);\n    if (zeta === 0) stateLabel.textContent = '无阻尼';\n    else if (zeta < 1) stateLabel.textContent = '欠阻尼';\n    else if (zeta === 1) stateLabel.textContent = '临界阻尼';\n    else stateLabel.textContent = '过阻尼';\n    resetSim();\n  });\n\n  function stepPhysics() {\n    const a = -2 * zeta * w0 * v - w0 * w0 * x;\n    v += a * dt;\n    x += v * dt;\n    t += dt;\n    points.push({ t, x });\n  }\n\n  function drawFrame() {\n    const W = canvas.getBoundingClientRect().width;\n    const H = canvas.getBoundingClientRect().height;\n    const bg = getThemeColor('--bg');\n    const ink = getThemeColor('--ink');\n    const accent = getThemeColor('--accent');\n    const line = getThemeColor('--line');\n\n    ctx.fillStyle = bg;\n    ctx.fillRect(0, 0, W, H);\n\n    const pad = 30;\n    const gW = W - pad * 2;\n    const gH = H - pad * 2;\n    const scaleX = gW / maxT;\n    const scaleY = gH / 2.5;\n\n    ctx.save();\n    ctx.translate(pad, H / 2);\n\n    // Grid\n    ctx.strokeStyle = line;\n    ctx.lineWidth = 0.5;\n    ctx.beginPath();\n    ctx.moveTo(0, -gH); ctx.lineTo(0, gH);\n    ctx.moveTo(-pad, 0); ctx.lineTo(gW, 0);\n    ctx.stroke();\n\n    // Envelope\n    ctx.strokeStyle = accent;\n    ctx.lineWidth = 1;\n    ctx.setLineDash([4, 4]);\n    ctx.beginPath();\n    for (let i = 0; i <= gW; i++) {\n      const ct = i / scaleX;\n      const env = Math.exp(-zeta * w0 * ct);\n      const py1 = -env * scaleY;\n      const py2 = env * scaleY;\n      if (i === 0) { ctx.moveTo(i, py1); } else { ctx.lineTo(i, py1); }\n    }\n    ctx.stroke();\n    ctx.beginPath();\n    for (let i = 0; i <= gW; i++) {\n      const ct = i / scaleX;\n      const env = Math.exp(-zeta * w0 * ct);\n      const py2 = env * scaleY;\n      if (i === 0) { ctx.moveTo(i, py2); } else { ctx.lineTo(i, py2); }\n    }\n    ctx.stroke();\n    ctx.setLineDash([]);\n\n    // Curve\n    ctx.strokeStyle = ink;\n    ctx.lineWidth = 2;\n    ctx.beginPath();\n    for (let i = 0; i < points.length; i++) {\n      const p = points[i];\n      const px = p.t * scaleX;\n      const py = -p.x * scaleY;\n      if (i === 0) ctx.moveTo(px, py); else ctx.lineTo(px, py);\n    }\n    ctx.stroke();\n\n    ctx.restore();\n  }\n\n  function animate() {\n    if (t < maxT) {\n      for(let i=0; i<2; i++) stepPhysics();\n      drawFrame();\n      animId = requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n    }\n  }\n\n  window.addEventListener('resize', resizeCanvas);\n  resizeCanvas();\n  resetSim();\n</script>",
          "id": "b4_sim"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "label": "临界阻尼",
          "text": "$ζ=1$ 恰好是不振荡的边界——左侧 $ζ<1$ 振荡衰减，右侧 $ζ>1$ 非振荡但变慢，最快回归落在这条线上。",
          "id": "b4_callout"
        }
      ],
      "layout": {
        "kind": "compose",
        "preset": "sidenote"
      }
